sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent /<br/>bootstrap
  participant S as Trusted sender
  participant C as OCC
  participant R as Credential<br/>Resolver
  A->>S: Authenticated operation
  S->>S: Capture immutable operation<br/>Select route and grant
  S->>C: 1. Current authority before access<br/>Caller, operation, versioned route and grant
  C-->>S: Allow, deny or unavailable
  break Denied or authority unavailable
    Note over A,C: Refuse before material access
    S-->>A: Refuse before material access
  end
  opt Allowed credentialed operation
    S->>R: Resolve admitted binding for this use
    R-->>S: Use-bound handle or typed refusal
    Note over S,R: Cold / expired dynamic material: NotReady<br/>No issuance, signing, refresh or scheduling<br/>No dynamic proxy cache or fallback
    break Denied, NotReady or Unavailable
      Note over A,C: Refuse before send
      S-->>A: Refuse before send
    end
  end
  Note over S,C: Credential-free egress skips resolution,<br/>not authorization
  S->>S: Complete transformations<br/>Freeze actual operation
  Note over S,C: Continue to final check<br/>A handle is not send authority
  Note over A,R: Management preparation has separate authorization<br/>Agent flags and bootstrap delegation cannot select it
